        // General rule (holds on P, broken by M): when the caller of this test is the contract deployer/owner, AdjustBetAmounts must revert after that caller called play().
        // We cannot read owner directly, so express rule over observable behavior only: calling AdjustBetAmounts immediately after play() must revert for the same EOA that previously interacted (the test caller). That is, reverted must be true.
        assert(reverted == true);
    }
